\par\par \uc2 Music\par \b \uc2 A timeline of allegations and charges against Sean \u8216\'20\'18Diddy\u8217\'20\'19 Combs\b0\par\par\uc2 Ben Beaumont-Thomas and Guardian staff \par \uc2 2,690 \uc2 words\par \uc2 12 May 2025\par 12:53 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Most recent lawsuits include accusations of drugging and raping as recently as 2022, and Jay-Z added as accused\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/diddy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Sean \u8220\'20\'1CDiddy\u8221\'20\'1D Combs}}}\uc2  is on trial in New York on charges of sex trafficking and racketeering. The 17-page indictment against Combs \u8211\'20\'13 which reads like a charging document filed against a mafia leader or the head of a drug gang \u8211\'20\'13 alleges that Combs engaged in a two-decade pattern of abusive behavior against women and others, with the help of people in his entourage and employees from his network of businesses.\par \par \uc2 Combs and his lawyers say he is innocent and any group sex was consensual. They say there was no effort to coerce people, and nothing that happened amounted to a criminal racket.\par \par \uc2 The trial is expected to last at least eight weeks. If convicted, Combs faces the possibility of decades in prison.\par \par \uc2 Here is a timeline of events:\par \par \uc2 2025\par \par \uc2 5 May\par \par \uc2 Combs\u8217\'20\'19s sex trafficking trial begins with jury selection\par \par \uc2 Combs\u8217\'20\'19s federal sex trafficking trial {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2025/may/05/sean-diddy-combs-sex-trafficking-trial-jury-selection"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 began in New York City}}}\uc2  with jury selection. It is expected the trial will last eight weeks.\par \par \uc2 The 17-page indictment against Combs alleges the music mogul engaged in a pattern of abusive behavior against women and others over the course of two decades, helped by his employees and people in his entourage.\par \par \uc2 18 April\par \par \uc2 Judge denies Combs\u8217\'20\'19 request to delay trial\par \par \uc2 Judge Arun Subramanian, who is overseeing the case, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/sean-diddy-combs-trial-date-2a40848ef9c524653800b1c5647f783f"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rules that}}}\uc2  the Combs sex-trafficking trial will move forward as scheduled and begin on 5 May.\par \par \uc2 16 April\par \par \uc2 Combs seeks two-month delay of trial\par \par \uc2 Combs\u8217\'20\'19s attorneys {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/sean-diddy-combs-trial-5b98b1a7df594066793193f524970e63"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ask a federal judge}}}\uc2  in New York to delay his 5 Maysex-trafficking trial by two months, arguing that they need more time to prepare a defense and they claim that the prosecutors have been slow to turn over some potential evidence.\par \par \uc2 Prosecutors opposes the request.\par \par \uc2 4 April\par \par \uc2 Federal prosecutors add two additional criminal charges to Combs\u8217\'20\'19 indictment\par \par \uc2 Federal prosecutors add {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2025/apr/04/sean-diddy-combs-counts-forced-labor"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 two additional criminal charges }}}\uc2 \u8211\'20\'13 one additional count of transportation to engage in prostitution \u8211\'20\'13 to Combs\u8217\'20\'19s indictment, so he now faces five federal charges.\par \par \uc2 Combs denies the allegations against him, and his attorneys release a statement saying: \u8220\'20\'1CThese are not new allegations or new accusers. These are the same individuals, former long-term girlfriends, who were involved in consensual relationships.\u8221\'20\'1D They add: \u8220\'20\'1CThis was their private sex life, defined by consent, not coercion.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 14 March\par \par \uc2 Combs pleads not guilty to new indictment\par \par \uc2 Combs {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/14/sean-diddy-combs-pleads-not-guilty-new-indictment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pleaded not guilty to a new indictment}}}\uc2 , which added accusations that the hip-hop mogul forced employees to work long hours and threatened to punish those who did not assist in his two-decade sex trafficking scheme.\par \par \uc2 4 February\par \par \uc2 More civil lawsuits are filed against Combs\par \par \uc2 A fresh {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2025/feb/05/sean-diddy-combs-faces-new-sexual-assault-lawsuits-as-he-awaits-trial"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 round of lawsuits alleging sexual assault are filed against Combs}}}\uc2 . The rapper and mogul continues to deny wrongdoing.\par \par \uc2 30 January\par \par \uc2 Prosecutors update the indictment against Combs\par \par \uc2 Federal prosecutors{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2025/01/30/entertainment/sean-diddy-combs-superseding-indictment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  file a superseding indictment }}}\uc2 against Combs, expanding the racketeering conspiracy allegations to include two additional victims, though no new charges are added.\par \par \uc2 In response, Combs\u8217\'20\'19s attorneys issued a statement saying: \u8220\'20\'1CThe government has added the ridiculous theory that two of Mr. Combs\u8217\'20\'19 former girlfriends were not girlfriends at all but were prostitutes. Mr. Combs is as committed as ever to fighting these charges and winning at trial.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 2024\par \par \uc2 12 December 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs accused of drugging and raping three men in lawsuits\par \par \uc2 Three more accusers file {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/dec/12/sean-diddy-combs-men-rape-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sexual assault lawsuits}}}\uc2  against Combs, alleging that they were drugged via spiked drinks and then raped in incidents as recently as 2022. The plaintiffs are all male and identified in court documents only as John Doe, according to NBC News.\par \par \uc2 Combs has denied all the allegations and pleaded not guilty.\par \par \uc2 9 December 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs and Jay-Z accused of rape in lawsuit\par \par \uc2 An amended lawsuit filed in federal court alleges that Combs and Jay-Z raped a 13-year-old girl during a party in 2000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/dec/10/jay-z-accuses-lawyer-behind-sean-diddy-combs-joint-allegation-of-trying-to-extort-exorbitant-sums"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Jay-Z denies the allegations on social media}}}\uc2  and lambastes the lawsuit, calling it part of a \u8220\'20\'1Cblackmail attempt\u8221\'20\'1D by the plaintiff\u8217\'20\'19s lawyer.\par \par \uc2 2 December 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs could have settled Ventura\u8217\'20\'19s suit privately but didn\u8217\'20\'19t\par \par \uc2 Combs had the opportunity to settle Ventura\u8217\'20\'19s accusations of rape and other physical abuse before she went public \u8211\'20\'13 but he refused, according to the forthcoming podcast The Rise and Fall of Diddy.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CShe came to him before she filed [any] lawsuit and said: \u8216\'20\'18I believed I was wronged by you,\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D attorney and legal commentator Donte Mills says on the podcast from Law & Crime, a preview of which was provided to the Guardian. \u8220\'20\'1CAnd she gave him an opportunity to settle the case before she brought [a] lawsuit.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 28 November 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs denied bail for the third time\par \par \uc2 Combs is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/nov/28/sean-diddy-combs-denied-bail-for-a-third-time-over-serious-risk-of-witness-tampering"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 denied bail for the third time}}}\uc2  by a judge in New York City who describes him as a \u8220\'20\'1Cserious risk\u8221\'20\'1D for witness tampering.\par \par \uc2 16 November 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs accused of reaching out to prospective witnesses from jail\par \par \uc2 Combs has tried to reach out to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/nov/16/sean-diddy-combs-jail"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 prospective witnesses and influence public opinion}}}\uc2  from jail in a bid to affect potential jurors for his upcoming sex-trafficking trial, prosecutors claim in a court filing that is part of a bail request.\par \par \uc2 21 October 2024\par \par \uc2 Five new federal civil lawsuits filed\par \par \uc2 A wave of new sexual assault and rape {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/oct/21/sean-diddy-combs-new-lawsuits"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accusations}}}\uc2  are made against Combs, including an accusation of rape from a then 13-year-old.\par \par \uc2 Among the plaintiffs, two are men and three are women. All of the alleged incidents reportedly occurred at parties hosted by the music mogul.\par \par \uc2 In one lawsuit, Jane Doe claims that in 2000, when she was 13 years old, Combs invited her to attend his MTV Video Music awards afterparty, where she was allegedly drugged and raped.\par \par \uc2 All five lawsuits are filed in the southern district of New York by the Texas-based attorney \uc2 Tony Buzbee\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe expect to be filing cases weekly naming Mr Combs and others as defendants as we continue to gather evidence and prepare the filings,\u8221\'20\'1D Buzbee says in a statement to NBC News.\par \par \uc2 15 October 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs wants prosecutors to disclose the names of his accusers\par \par \uc2 Combs wants prosecutors in his sex-trafficking case to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/oct/15/sean-diddy-combs-judge-sex-trafficking-case-accusers"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 disclose the names of his accusers}}}\uc2 , Manhattan federal court documents show.\par \par \uc2 The music executive needs to know the identities of his accusers to prepare for the 5 May trial, his legal team argues in a Tuesday letter to Judge Arun Subramanian.\par \par \uc2 14 October 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs hit with six new lawsuits alleging rape and sexual assault\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/oct/14/sean-diddy-combs-lawsuits"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Combs is hit with six new lawsuits}}}\uc2  that accuse the rap impresario of raping women, sexually assaulting men and molesting a 16-year-old boy.\par \par \uc2 The plaintiffs in the lawsuits, filed anonymously in federal court under New York\u8217\'20\'19s Gender-Motivated Violence Act, are identified only as two women \u8211\'20\'13 Jane Does \u8211\'20\'13 and four men, John Does.\par \par \uc2 The accusers are part of what their attorney says is a group of more than 100 alleged victims who are in the process of suing Combs in the wake of his arrest in September.\par \par \uc2 In a statement, attorneys for Combs say a new tip line and the new filings are \u8220\'20\'1Cclear attempts to garner publicity\u8221\'20\'1D. The statement maintains that \u8220\'20\'1CMr Combs has never sexually assaulted anyone \u8211\'20\'13 adult or minor, man or woman.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 10 October 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs sex-trafficking trial to start in May 2025, judge decides\par \par \uc2 Combs\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/oct/10/sean-diddy-combs-appear-court"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sex-trafficking trial is scheduled to start on 5 May 2025}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 During an appearance in Manhattan, prosecutors reveal that authorities seized 96 electronic devices in raids of Combs\u8217\'20\'19s Miami and Los Angeles homes, as well as a private airport in south Florida.\par \par \uc2 Prosecutors say Combs might face more charges, something they have floated during prior court proceedings.\par \par \uc2 Combs\u8217\'20\'19s lawyers have pushed unsuccessfully to get him freed on bail since his 16 September arrest.\par \par \uc2 1 October 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs faces sexual misconduct allegations from 120 accusers\par \par \uc2 Tony Buzbee\uc2 , a Texas-based attorney, reveals at a press conference that he is representing {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/oct/01/sean-diddy-combs-120-victims-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 120 accusers who allege misconduct against Combs}}}\uc2  over the course of two decades.\par \par \uc2 Andrew Van Arsdale, one of the plaintiffs\u8217\'20\'19 attorneys, tells the \uc2 Washington Post\uc2  that there will be 120 individual lawsuits filed in New York, Los Angeles and Miami in the coming weeks. He says that more than 3,000 individuals have come forward to his office with accusations against Combs.\par \par \uc2 Buzbee says that the new civil claims against Combs will include \u8220\'20\'1Cviolent sexual assault or rape, facilitated sex with a controlled substance, dissemination of video recordings, sexual abuse of minors\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 24 September 2024\par \par \uc2 Thalia Graves files lawsuit against Combs\par \par \uc2 Thalia Graves alleges in a new lawsuit that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/sep/24/thalia-graves-diddy-allegations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Combs and his bodyguard sexually assaulted her}}}\uc2  some two decades earlier and distributed video of their attack.\par \par \uc2 17 September 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs denied bail in sex-trafficking and racketeering case\par \par \uc2 Combs is denied {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/sep/17/sean-diddy-combs-indictment-charges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bail and ordered to jail}}}\uc2  as he faces charges of sex trafficking and racketeering. He appears in court in New York and pleads not guilty. His lawyers try unsuccessfully to keep him out of jail, requesting his release to home detention, travel restrictions and a $50m bond in Manhattan court. Prosecutors argue that Combs is \u8220\'20\'1Ca serious flight risk\u8221\'20\'1D and has \u8220\'20\'1Cthe money, manpower and tools\u8221\'20\'1D to flee without detection.\par \par \uc2 16 September 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs is arrested and charged in New York\par \par \uc2 Combs is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/sep/17/sean-diddy-combs-arrest-new-york-grand-jury-indictment-ntwnfb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 arrested}}}\uc2  in New York and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/sep/17/sean-diddy-combs-indictment-charges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 charged}}}\uc2  with three counts of sex trafficking and racketeering, in a federal indictment that describes \u8220\'20\'1Ca criminal enterprise whose members and associates engaged in, and attempted to engage in, among other crimes, sex trafficking, forced labor, kidnapping, arson, bribery, and obstruction of justice\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 11 September 2024\par \par \uc2 Lawsuit filed by Dawn Richard\par \par \uc2 Following Ventura, another high-profile musician {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/sep/11/dawn-richard-sues-sean-diddy-combs-sexual-assault"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 files her own lawsuit}}}\uc2  against Combs. Dawn Richard, who was part of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/sep/17/sean-combs-charges-aubrey-oday-danity-kane"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Combs-signed girl group Danity Kane}}}\uc2  and later a trio with him called Diddy \u8211\'20\'13 Dirty Money, alleges that Combs sexually assaulted her on multiple occasions by touching her body, as well as verbally abusing and overworking her. She also alleges seeing him physically assault Ventura on numerous occasions.\par \par \uc2 10 September 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs a no-show at a hearing\par \par \uc2 Combs does not appear at a virtual hearing for a lawsuit filed against him by Derrick Lee Cardello-Smith, who alleges he was drugged and sexually assaulted by Combs at a party in Detroit in 1997. The no-show leads to a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/article/2024/sep/10/sean-diddy-combs-sexual-assault-default-judgment"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 default judgement against Combs}}}\uc2  of $100m to be paid to Cardello-Smith, who is currently incarcerated following an unrelated case. Combs\u8217\'20\'19s lawyers say they hope to have the case dismissed, claiming Combs has never heard of Cardello-Smith; on 13 September, emergency motions are filed by \uc2 Combs\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s legal team to try to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/sep/13/sean-diddy-combs-derrick-lee-cardello-smith-accused-assault"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 overturn the ruling}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 4 July 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs says he is innocent as he faces eighth lawsuit\par \par \uc2 Via his lawyers, Combs again proclaims his innocence as he faces his eighth lawsuit alleging sexual assault. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/article/2024/jul/04/sean-diddy-combs-accused-of-grooming-and-coercing-woman-into-sex-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Adria English claims}}}\uc2  she was \u8220\'20\'1Cgroomed into sex trafficking over time\u8221\'20\'1D at events between 2004 and 2009 at Combs\u8217\'20\'19s famous, star-studded \u8220\'20\'1Cwhite parties\u8221\'20\'1D. \u8220\'20\'1CNo matter how many lawsuits are filed it won\u8217\'20\'19t change the fact that Mr Combs has never sexually assaulted or sex-trafficked anyone,\u8221\'20\'1D the lawyer Jonathan Davis says.\par \par \uc2 7 June 2024\par \par \uc2 Howard University\uc2  revokes honorary degree\par \par \uc2 Howard University\uc2  in Washington DC announces that it is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/article/2024/jun/08/howard-university-revokes-sean-combs-honorary-degree-scholarship"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 revoking an honorary degree}}}\uc2  it awarded Combs, returning a $1m donation and ending a scholarship program in his name. The following week, Combs is ordered to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/article/2024/jun/15/sean-combs-key-new-york-city-returned"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 return the ceremonial key}}}\uc2  to New York City by Mayor Eric Adams, who writes that he is \u8220\'20\'1Cdeeply disturbed\u8221\'20\'1D by the video footage of Combs assaulting Ventura.\par \par \uc2 22 May 2024\par \par \uc2 Crystal McKinney files a lawsuit\par \par \uc2 The model Crystal McKinney {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/article/2024/may/21/sean-diddy-combs-new-lawsuit-sexual-assault"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 files a lawsuit}}}\uc2  against Combs, alleging that he drugged her and forced her to perform oral sex in a 2003 incident. Later that week, another woman, April Lampros, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/article/2024/may/24/sean-diddy-combs-accused-of-sexual-assault-in-seventh-such-lawsuit-in-recent-months"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 files her own lawsuit}}}\uc2  alleging four instances of sexual assault between 1995 and about 2000, as well as the allegation that Combs filmed one of the incidents and showed it to others.\par \par \uc2 17 May 2024\par \par \uc2 CNN publishes shocking footage of Combs assaulting Ventura\par \par \uc2 CNN publishes {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/article/2024/may/17/video-p-diddy-assault-cassie-ventura"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surveillance footage}}}\uc2  of Combs assaulting Ventura at a Los Angeles hotel in 2016. The following day, Combs {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/article/2024/may/19/sean-diddy-combs-cassie-attack-video-apology"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 apologises}}}\uc2 , saying: \u8220\'20\'1CI take full responsibility for my actions in that video. I was disgusted then when I did it. I\u8217\'20\'19m disgusted now.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 25 March 2024\par \par \uc2 Raids at \uc2 Combs\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s properties in Los Angeles and Miami\par \par \uc2 According to unnamed law enforcement sources, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2024/mar/25/sean-diddy-properties-raided-homeland-security"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US federal agents raid}}}\uc2  Combs\u8217\'20\'19s properties in Los Angeles and Miami as part of a sex-trafficking investigation. No charges are made against Combs at this stage.\par \par \uc2 26 February 2024\par \par \uc2 Combs sued by Rodney Jones\par \par \uc2 Combs is sued by the music producer Rodney Jones, who alleges Combs groped him and attempted to \u8220\'20\'1Cgroom him into accepting a homosexual relationship\u8221\'20\'1D, during sessions for Combs\u8217\'20\'19s 2023 release The Love Album: Off the Grid. A lawyer for Combs describes the allegation as \u8220\'20\'1Cpure fiction\u8221\'20\'1D, and later, on 26 August, Combs {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/article/2024/aug/26/sean-diddy-combs-dismiss-rodney-jones-case"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 calls on a judge}}}\uc2  to throw out the case.\par \par \uc2 2o23\par \par \uc2 6 December 2023\par \par \uc2 Combs denies all allegations\par \par \uc2 Combs {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2023/dec/06/sean-diddy-combs-rape-allegation-new-york"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 denies all allegations}}}\uc2  made against him in the preceding weeks, including in a new lawsuit filed by another anonymous woman who alleges Combs participated in a gang rape against her and sex-trafficked her when she was 17. \u8220\'20\'1CI did not do any of the awful things being alleged. I will fight for my name, my family and for the truth,\u8221\'20\'1D Combs says.\par \par \uc2 29 November 2023\par \par \uc2 Combs steps down as chair of Revolt\par \par \uc2 Combs {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/sean-diddy-combs-revolt-dd35eebf93f8d5c384f5b4ac2ddfd232"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 steps down}}}\uc2  as chair of the TV network he founded, Revolt. The following week, Hulu {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/news/us-news/reality-tv-show-diddys-family-pulled-sexual-assault-lawsuits-rcna129705"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 scraps plans}}}\uc2  for a reality show, produced by James Corden\u8217\'20\'19s company Fulwell 73, that was to focus on Combs and his family.\par \par \uc2 24 November 2023\par \par \uc2 Two new lawsuits filed over sexual attacks\par \par \uc2 Combs is accused of sexual assault dating back to 1991 in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2023/nov/24/sean-diddy-combs-accused-of-sexual-assault-and-revenge-porn-in-two-new-lawsuits"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 two new lawsuits}}}\uc2 : one anonymously by a woman who claims Combs and another man coerced her into sex; the other by Joi Dickerson-Neal, who alleges Combs drugged and sexually assaulted her, as well as filming the incident and showing it to others. Later, on 26 April 2024, Combs\u8217\'20\'19s lawyers file a motion to dismiss elements of Dickerson-Neal\u8217\'20\'19s lawsuit.\par \par \uc2 These lawsuits, and some of the other subsequent ones filed against Combs, are made possible by New York state laws such as the Adult Survivors Act and the Victims of Gender-Motivated Violence Act that allow for lawsuits alleging sexual assault to be made even if the statute of limitations \u8211\'20\'13 the window of time for allegations to be made \u8211\'20\'13 has expired.\par \par \uc2 2023\par \par \uc2 17 November 2023\par \par \uc2 Ventura settles lawsuit\par \par \uc2 Ventura and Combs announce their lawsuit has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2023/nov/17/sean-diddy-combs-cassie-settle-abuse-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 settled}}}\uc2  with undisclosed terms. Ventura says in a statement: \u8220\'20\'1CI have decided to resolve this matter amicably on terms that I have some level of control.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 16 November 2023\par \par \uc2 Casandra Ventura files a lawsuit alleging horrific attacks and abuse\par \par \uc2 Casandra Ventura, a singer and model known as Cassie who dated Combs for more than a decade, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2023/nov/16/sean-combs-diddy-cassie-sexual-assault-lawsuit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 files a lawsuit against him}}}\uc2 , alleging incidents of rape and physical assault between 2007 and 2018. She describes \u8220\'20\'1Ca cycle of abuse, violence, and sex trafficking\u8221\'20\'1D after being lured into an \u8220\'20\'1Costentatious, fast-paced, and drug-fueled lifestyle\u8221\'20\'1D allegedly designed to keep her compliant \u8211\'20\'13 including engaging in sex acts with others against her will. The lawsuit also alleges that Combs destroyed the car of another successful US rapper, Kid Cudi \u8211\'20\'13 real name Scott Mescudi \u8211\'20\'13 to deter him from seeing Ventura. Combs denies the allegations.\par \par \uc2 The severity of Ventura\u8217\'20\'19s allegations are the most serious Combs faces. He was charged with assault in 1998 and sentenced to an anger management class; in 1999, he was acquitted of gun charges following a nightclub shooting. In 2019, an ex-girlfriend, Gina Huynh, spoke to a blogger alleging emotional and physical abuse during her relationship with Combs, but no legal case was filed.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250512el5c001ry\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
