\par\par \uc2 Business\par \b \uc2 Democrats in Congress warn cuts at top US labor watchdog will be \u8216\'20\'18catastrophic\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 460 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 April 2025\par 17:55 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Musk\u8217\'20\'19s Doge targets \uc2 National Labor Relations Board\uc2  with cuts and terminated leases as union speaks out\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/democrats"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Democrats }}}\uc2  have warned that cuts to the US\u8217\'20\'19s top labor watchdog threaten to render the organization \u8220\'20\'1Cbasically ineffectual\u8221\'20\'1D and will be \u8220\'20\'1Ccatastrophic\u8221\'20\'1D for workers\u8217\'20\'19 rights.\par \par \uc2 The so-called \u8220\'20\'1Cdepartment of government efficiency\u8221\'20\'1D (Doge) has targeted the \uc2 National Labor Relations Board\uc2  (\uc2 NLRB\uc2  ) for cuts and ended its leases in several states.\par \par \uc2 Representatives Bobby Scott, Mark DeSaulnier and Greg Casar have written to \uc2 NLRB\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s chair, \uc2 Marvin Kaplan\uc2  , and the acting general counsel, William Cowen, requesting answers on the cuts.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf the \uc2 NLRB\uc2  reduces its workforce and closes a number of regional offices, it will render the \uc2 NLRB\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s enforcement mechanism basically ineffectual, thereby chilling workers from exercising their rights to engage in union organizing and protected concerted activities,\u8221\'20\'1D they wrote.\par \par \uc2 The letter noted the \uc2 NLRB\uc2  has already been suffering from drastic understaffing and budget constraints, while caseloads have increased. \uc2 NLRB\uc2  field staffing has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://federalnewsnetwork.com/workforce/2024/05/nlrb-doing-more-with-less-between-growing-caseload-stagnating-staffing/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 declined }}}\uc2  by one-third in the last decade, while case intake per employee at the agency grew by 46%.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe harm to America\u8217\'20\'19s workers by potential directives to reduce this independent agency\u8217\'20\'19s workforce cannot be overstated,\u8221\'20\'1D the letter added. \u8220\'20\'1CAny \uc2 NLRB\uc2  reduction in force (RIF) or office closures would be catastrophic for workers\u8217\'20\'19 rights.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The representatives also requested all information related to Doge\u8217\'20\'19s role at the \uc2 NLRB\uc2  , including all communications Doge had with employees at the \uc2 NLRB\uc2  or regarding the \uc2 NLRB\uc2  with other agencies. <aside class="element element-rich-link element--thumbnail">\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/feb/05/gwynne-wilcox-nlrb-lawsuit-trump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dismissed labor official sues Trump and NLRB chair over firing }}}\uc2  </aside>\par \par \uc2 Doge is led by billionaire Trump donor {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elon Musk }}}\uc2 . Musk\u8217\'20\'19s \uc2 SpaceX\uc2  has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/mar/10/starbucks-trader-joes-spacex-challenge-labor-board"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 challenged }}}\uc2  the constitutionality of the \uc2 NLRB\uc2  . A whistleblower at the \uc2 NLRB{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.npr.org/2025/04/27/1247657625/doge-whistleblower-nlrb"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told }}}\uc2 NPR\uc2  earlier this month that Doge accessed sensitive data at the agency and took steps to cover their tracks in doing so.\par \par \uc2 The National Labor Relations Board Union, representing workers at the agency, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bsky.app/profile/nlrbu.bsky.social/post/3lkr647uov22q"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported }}}\uc2  last week that Doge cancelled the \uc2 NLRB\uc2  regional office\u8217\'20\'19s lease a year early in Milwaukee, Wisconsin, ending it in August 2025.\par \par \uc2 In March 2025, Doge terminated the lease for the \uc2 NLRB\uc2  regional office in Memphis, Tennessee. In February 2025, Doge {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.schumer.senate.gov/newsroom/press-releases/with-doge-listing-buffalo-national-labor-relations-board-office-on-the-chopping-block-and-uncertainty-for-whats-next-schumer-demands-answers-to-protect-western-new-york-workers-and-unions-labor-rights"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 terminated }}}\uc2  the leases for \uc2 NLRB{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://doge.gov/savings"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 offices }}}\uc2  in Buffalo, New York; Puerto Rico; Los Angeles, California; Overland Park, Kansas; and Birmingham, Alabama.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe \uc2 NLRB\uc2  is an agency that has been starved of funding and resources for over a decade. We have seen massive staffing cuts simply from attrition. There is no need for any austerity measures with our operations; Congress has already done that to us.\u8221\'20\'1D the NLRB Union {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bsky.app/profile/nlrbu.bsky.social/post/3lndmy7s24c23"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stated }}}\uc2  on social media.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 NLRB\uc2  declined to comment.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250428el4s002ju\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
