\par\par \uc2 Business\par \b \uc2 US added 228,000 jobs in March despite Trump\u8217\'20\'19s deep cuts to federal workforce\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 489 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 April 2025\par 01:55 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Figure up from 117,000 jobs added in February, far higher than expected, as unemployment rose slightly to 4.2%\par \par \uc2 The US added 228,000 jobs in March, far more than expected, as the US economy shook off the blow from the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/trump-administration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump administration}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s deep cuts to federal workers.\par \par \uc2 The figure was up from an adjusted 117,000 jobs {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/mar/07/us-february-jobs-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  in February. Unemployment rose slightly to 4.2%.\par \par \uc2 Economists anticipated 140,000 jobs would be added in March 2025, a slight decrease from February and a continued decline from the monthly average of 167,000 jobs over the past 12 months. Payroll firm ADP {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/adp-national-employment-report-private-sector-employment-increased-by-155-000-jobs-in-march-annual-pay-was-up-4-6-302418421.html#:~:text=ADP%20National%20Employment%20Report%3A%20Private%20Sector%20Employment%20Increased%20by%2077%2C000,Annual%20Pay%20was%20Up%204.7%25"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  155,000 jobs were added in the private sector for March 2025.\par \par \uc2 The report comes after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  announced a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/apr/03/trumps-tariffs-the-full-list"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stunning new trade policy}}}\uc2  \u8211\'20\'13 imposing tariffs on the US\u8217\'20\'19s trading partners at rates of between 10% and 50%. It may take months for the impacts of that decision to work their way into the jobs figures.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGREAT JOB NUMBERS, FAR BETTER THAN EXPECTED. IT\u8217\'20\'19S ALREADY WORKING. HANG TOUGH, WE CAN\u8217\'20\'19T LOSE!!!\u8221\'20\'1D Trump wrote on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://truthsocial.com/@realDonaldTrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Truth Social.}}}\par \par \uc2 In Canada, which has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/apr/02/trumps-tariff-war-a-timeline-of-key-announcements-and-events"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 under the threat}}}\uc2  of Trump tariffs since November, employment dropped by 32,600 people, the first decrease in more than two years.\par \par \uc2 March\u8217\'20\'19s gains came in healthcare, social assistance, transportation, and warehousing and retail. Federal government employment declined by 4,000 in March, following a loss of 11,000 jobs in February.\par \par \uc2 March\u8217\'20\'19s strong growth was tempered by a cut of 48,000 to the tally of gains in the previous two months. And outside of the government\u8217\'20\'19s official figures, there are already signs that the resilience of the US job market is being tested.\par \par \uc2 The outplacement firm \uc2 Challenger, Gray & Christmas{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.challengergray.com/blog/federal-cuts-dominate-march-2025-total-275240-announced-job-cuts-216670-from-doge-actions/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  US-based employers announced 275,240 job cuts in March 2025, led by actions by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elon Musk}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s so-called \u8220\'20\'1Cdepartment of government efficiency\u8221\'20\'1D, a 60% increase from the previous month and the third-highest total ever recorded since the firm began reporting job firm cuts in 1989.\par \par \uc2 Announcements of job cuts included steel producer and supplier \uc2 Cleveland-Cliffs\uc2 , which {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.manufacturingdive.com/news/cleveland-cliffs-layoffs-canada-metal-nucor-steel-tariffs-trump/743772/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shared plans}}}\uc2  this month to lay off 1,200 workers in Michigan and Minnesota, citing decreased demand for automotive vehicles.\par \par \uc2 Whirlpool{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.desmoinesregister.com/story/money/business/2025/04/01/whirlpool-layoffs-amana-iowa-plant-losing-one-third-of-workforce/82757127007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced }}}\uc2  650 layoffs at a manufacturing plant in Iowa. Chipmaker Wolfspeed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.manufacturingdive.com/news/march-2025-layoffs-factory-closures-siemens-wolfspeed-milgard-sps/743911/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  180 job cuts in North Carolina. \uc2 Milgard Manufacturing{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.manufacturingdive.com/news/march-2025-layoffs-factory-closures-siemens-wolfspeed-milgard-sps/743911/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  plans to shutter a factory in Ventura, California, resulting in 397 jobs lost in May 2025. Aerospace contractor \uc2 SPS Technologies{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.pa.gov/agencies/dli/programs-services/workforce-development-home/warn-requirements/warn-notices.html#accordion-8f171c7304-item-1027ca0b6c"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 issued}}}\uc2  a notification of plans to lay off 251 workers from a Pennsylvania factory in May 2025.\par \par \uc2 The US economy has continued to grow in spite of uncertainty around Trump\u8217\'20\'19s policies, including tariffs and cuts to the federal workforce and funding programs. Consumer confidence {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.conference-board.org/topics/consumer-confidence#:~:text=Latest%20Press%20Release,to%20a%2012%2Dyear%20low."}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropped}}}\uc2  to a 12-year low in March 2025.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250404el4400232\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
