\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 RFK Jr says 20% of Doge\u8217\'20\'19s health agency job cuts were mistakes\b0\par\par\uc2 Oliver Milman \par \uc2 389 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 April 2025\par 01:53 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Health secretary says roles will need to be reinstated amid Trump administration\u8217\'20\'19s push to slash federal workforce\par \par \uc2 Around a fifth of the 10,000 jobs cut from the US Department of Health and Human Services (\uc2 HHS\uc2 ) were done in error and will need to be corrected, the US health secretary, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/robert-f-kennedy-jr"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Robert F Kennedy Jr}}}\uc2 , has admitted.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/apr/01/trump-health-agency-layoffs-cuts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Mass layoffs from the health department}}}\uc2  began this week amid a push by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/trump-administration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 administration}}}\uc2  to shrink the size of the federal government workforce. Union representatives were told around 10,000 people were to lose their jobs ahead of further reductions that could see the department\u8217\'20\'19s 82,000-strong workforce slashed by nearly a quarter.\par \par \uc2 But Kennedy, the former environmental lawyer and vaccine skeptic turned Trump ally, has said that a large slice of the layoffs by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elon Musk}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s unofficial \u8220\'20\'1Cdepartment of government efficiency\u8221\'20\'1D (Doge) are mistaken.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CPersonnel that should not have been cut, were cut,\u8221\'20\'1D Kennedy told reporters on Thursday. \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re reinstating them. And that was always the plan. Part of the Doge, we talked about this from the beginning, is we\u8217\'20\'19re going to do 80% cuts, but 20% of those are going to have to be reinstated, because we\u8217\'20\'19ll make mistakes.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The US health secretary said that some of the people who lost their jobs were not in the administrative roles that were targeted by Doge, with the cull also affecting research work.\par \par \uc2 A program by the \uc2 Centers for Disease Control and Prevention\uc2  (CDC) that monitors for lead exposure in children was among the work mistakenly gutted by the layoffs, Kennedy said. \u8220\'20\'1CThere were some programs that were cut that are being reinstated, and I believe that that\u8217\'20\'19s one,\u8221\'20\'1D he said.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s still not clear which staff will be reinstated or what functions the health department will retain. The huge job cuts have affected {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/apr/02/hhs-cdc-fda-layoffs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 broad swaths of the department\u8217\'20\'19s work}}}\uc2 , with experts lost across areas as diverse as smoking, infertility and mine safety.\par \par \uc2 The cuts to the Food and Drug Administration (\uc2 FDA\uc2 ) included the division devoted to crafting tobacco policy, which was paid for by the tobacco industry.\par \par \uc2 Robert Califf\uc2 , former \uc2 FDA\uc2  commissioner, said the layoffs were \u8220\'20\'1Ca dark day for public health\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250404el440023c\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
