\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 FBI\uc2  forms taskforce over rising reports of vandalism at \uc2 Tesla\uc2  dealerships\b0\par\par\uc2 Richard Luscombe \par \uc2 725 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 March 2025\par 16:14 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Amid protests, White House officials close ranks around the \uc2 Tesla\uc2  owner leading efforts to slash federal jobs\par \par \uc2 Escalating reports of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/24/tesla-austin-bomb-squad"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 vandalism at Tesla dealerships}}}\uc2  and charging stations across the US have prompted the \uc2 FBI\uc2  to create a taskforce to target the perpetrators.\par \par \uc2 The development, announced by Kash Patel, the bureau\u8217\'20\'19s director, comes as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/trump-administration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 White House}}}\uc2  officials close ranks around {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elon Musk}}}\uc2 , the \uc2 Tesla\uc2  owner and world\u8217\'20\'19s richest person who has been leading efforts to slash federal jobs and budgets as head of the \u8220\'20\'1Cdepartment of government efficiency\u8221\'20\'1D (Doge).\par \par \uc2 Protests against the cutbacks have taken place at dozens of the electrical vehicle maker\u8217\'20\'19s dealerships in recent days and weeks, with some taking on a sinister air. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/24/tesla-austin-bomb-squad"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Incendiary devices were discovered}}}\uc2  at a \uc2 Tesla\uc2  property in Austin, Texas, on Monday. And a man in West Palm Beach, Florida, near Trump\u8217\'20\'19s Mar-a-Lago resort, was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://abcnews.go.com/US/florida-man-arrested-after-driving-car-protesters-tesla/story?id=120094773"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 charged with aggravated assault}}}\uc2  after allegedly trying to drive into a group of protesters on Saturday.\par \par \uc2 Patel gave no details about the makeup of the taskforce, which comes amid reports he is bolstering his agency\u8217\'20\'19s numbers by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnn.com/2025/03/22/politics/atf-agents-fbi/index.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reassigning up to 1,000 agents}}}\uc2  from the \uc2 Bureau of Alcohol, Tobacco, Firearms and Explosives\uc2  (ATF) \u8211\'20\'13 of which he is also acting director \u8211\'20\'13 to the \uc2 FBI\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Ben Williamson, the \uc2 FBI\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s assistant director of public affairs, confirmed its formation {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/_WilliamsonBen/status/1904250489673540090"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in a tweet}}}\uc2  and said the taskforce would work \u8220\'20\'1Cin conjunction with ATF to coordinate investigative activity and crack down on violent \uc2 Tesla\uc2  attacks\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 A group called TeslaTakedown is planning a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.instagram.com/p/DHbgCuyvTAD/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 global day of action}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D this Saturday at hundreds of \uc2 Tesla\uc2  locations around the world, urging people to \u8220\'20\'1Cturn out in numbers to fight \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s illegal coup\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Tesla\uc2  sales have plummeted {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2025/mar/24/tesla-sales-eu-slump-elon-musks-donald-trump-byd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 by almost 45% in Europe}}}\uc2 . And the company\u8217\'20\'19s stock market value {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/20/howard-lutnick-tesla-trump-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has tanked}}}\uc2  since Musk\u8217\'20\'19s Doge began firing thousands of federal employees and cutting budgets at numerous agencies at the behest of Trump, whom the \uc2 Tesla\uc2  CEO supported as he successfully ran for a second presidency in November.\par \par \uc2 Trump has falsely {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/11/trump-tesla-boycott-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 labeled a boycott of Tesla products as \u8220\'20\'1Cillegal\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  and called acts of vandalism such as setting fire to \uc2 Tesla\uc2  vehicles or charging stations domestic terrorism. Patel repeated the claim on Monday {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://x.com/FBIDirectorKash/status/1904253808374649020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in a tweet}}}\uc2  insisting that \u8220\'20\'1Cthose responsible will be pursued, caught, and brought to justice\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 On Friday, Trump warned \u8220\'20\'1Csick terrorist thugs\u8221\'20\'1D convicted of arson or other offenses of violence at \uc2 Tesla\uc2  dealerships that they risked being {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.newsweek.com/trump-touts-prison-el-salvador-tesla-attackers-2048498"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sent to prison in El Salvador}}}\uc2  to serve 20-year sentences.\par \par \uc2 TeslaTakedown, meanwhile, said people have the right to protest peacefully on sidewalks and streets in front of the company\u8217\'20\'19s showrooms. \u8220\'20\'1CPeaceful protest on public property is not domestic terrorism. We will not be bullied or allow our rights to be trampled on or stolen,\u8221\'20\'1D the group said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 Other senior Trump administration officials have also stepped in. On Sunday, the attorney general, Pam Bondi, warned a Democratic Texas congresswoman, Jasmine Crockett, to \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2025/03/23/bondi-jasmine-crockett-musk-tesla-protests-00244256"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tread very carefully}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D after she recently appeared at a virtual rally hosted by TeslaTakedown and called for Musk \u8220\'20\'1Cto be taken down\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Crockett said during the rally that her call was for nonviolent action.\par \par \uc2 Bondi told Fox\u8217\'20\'19s Sunday Morning Futures: \u8220\'20\'1CShe is an elected public official, so she needs to tread very carefully because nothing will happen to \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 , and we\u8217\'20\'19re going to fight to protect all of the \uc2 Tesla\uc2  owners throughout this country.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Bondi recently {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/20/charges-tesla-violent-destruction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced charges}}}\uc2  against three people accused of \u8220\'20\'1Cviolent destruction of \uc2 Tesla\uc2  properties\u8221\'20\'1D after incidents in three states.\par \par \uc2 One person was accused of being armed with an AR-15 rifle and throwing molotov cocktails at a Salem, Oregon, dealership. And a second was arrested in Loveland, Colorado, for allegedly trying to set a building on fire.\par \par \uc2 Authorities in Charleston, South Carolina, said they charged a person who allegedly \u8220\'20\'1Cwrote profane messages against President Trump around \uc2 Tesla\uc2  charging stations before lighting the charging stations on fire with molotov cocktails\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 In a statement, Bondi said the unnamed defendants will face \u8220\'20\'1Cthe full force of the law\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 She wrote: \u8220\'20\'1CThe days of committing crimes without consequence have ended. Let this be a warning: if you join this wave of domestic terrorism against \uc2 Tesla\uc2  properties, the Department of Justice will put you behind bars.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250325el3p0020a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
