\par\par \uc2 Business\par \b \uc2 Boeing\uc2  whistleblower\u8217\'20\'19s family claims company\u8217\'20\'19s conduct caused his suicide\b0\par\par\uc2 Jasper Jolly and agencies \par \uc2 551 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 March 2025\par 13:38 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Lawsuit alleges US plane maker\u8217\'20\'19s treatment of John Barnett caused his death after he raised safety concerns\par \par \uc2 The family of a whistleblower at \uc2 Boeing{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2024/mar/12/boeing-whistleblower-found-dead"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 who killed himself last year}}}\uc2  is suing the US plane manufacturer, alleging the company\u8217\'20\'19s conduct caused his death.\par \par \uc2 Boeing\uc2  pushed John Barnett to his death by harassing and intimidating him after he raised safety concerns about the company\u8217\'20\'19s plant building the 787 Dreamliner in Charleston, South Carolina, a wrongful death lawsuit filed in federal court in the state alleges.\par \par \uc2 The world\u8217\'20\'19s second-largest aeroplane maker has faced significant scrutiny over its safety during a years-long crisis started by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2019/jun/17/boeing-737-max-ethiopian-airlines-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 two fatal crashes of its bestselling 737 Max aircraft}}}\uc2  in 2018 and 2019. Last year a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2024/jan/06/alaska-airlines-grounds-boeing-737-max-9-planes-after-mid-air-window-blowout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 door panel blew out of a Boeing plane in mid-air}}}\uc2  after engineers failed to replace crucial bolts, raising yet more concerns over the company\u8217\'20\'19s safety culture.\par \par \uc2 The crises have also raised questions over how \uc2 Boeing\uc2  treated people voicing concerns.\par \par \uc2 Barnett was a quality manager at \uc2 Boeing\uc2  for nearly three decades, starting at Everett, Washington state, before his move to South Carolina. He took early retirement in 2017, at which point he was experiencing symptoms of depression and severe anxiety, according to the claim.\par \par \uc2 He then shared concerns over \uc2 Boeing\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s safety processes with journalists, becoming known publicly as a whistleblower. His allegations included finding metal shavings near critical control wires, and problems with onboard oxygen systems.\par \par \uc2 His family claim in their suit that \uc2 Boeing\uc2  responded by carrying out a \u8220\'20\'1Ccampaign of harassment, abuse and intimidation intended to discourage, discredit and humiliate him until he would either give up or be discredited\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 Barnett was found dead with a gunshot wound in his truck in a hotel car park on 9 March last year, days after giving evidence in a whistleblower lawsuit against the company.\par \par \uc2 In a statement this week, \uc2 Boeing\uc2  said: \u8220\'20\'1CWe are saddened by John Barnett\u8217\'20\'19s death and extend our condolences to his family.\u8221\'20\'1D The company was approached for further comment.\par \par \uc2 However, Barnett\u8217\'20\'19s family alleged that \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Boeing\uc2  had threatened to break John, and break him it did\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 They said the aeroplane maker intentionally gave Barnett inaccurate, poor job reviews and less desirable shifts, and that the company publicly blamed him for delays that angered his co-workers and prevented him from transferring to another plant.\par \par \uc2 The lawsuit alleged: \u8220\'20\'1CWhether or not \uc2 Boeing\uc2  intended to drive John to his death or merely destroy his ability to function, it was absolutely foreseeable that PTSD and John\u8217\'20\'19s unbearable depression, panic attacks, and anxiety \u8230\'20\'26 would in turn lead to an elevated risk of suicide.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\uc2 Boeing\uc2  may not have pulled the trigger, but \uc2 Boeing\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s conduct was the clear cause, and the clear foreseeable cause, of John\u8217\'20\'19s death.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 In the UK and Ireland, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.samaritans.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Samaritans}}}\uc2  can be contacted on freephone 116 123, or email {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:jo@samaritans.org"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jo@samaritans.org}}}\uc2  or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "mailto:jo@samaritans.ie"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jo@samaritans.ie}}}\uc2 . In the US, you can call or text the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://988lifeline.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 National Suicide Prevention Lifeline}}}\uc2  on 988, chat on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://988lifeline.org/chat/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 988lifeline.org}}}\uc2 , or {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.crisistextline.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 text HOME}}}\uc2  to 741741 to connect with a crisis counsellor. In Australia, the crisis support service {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.lifeline.org.au/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Lifeline}}}\uc2  is 13 11 14. Other international helplines can be found at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.befrienders.org/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 befrienders.org}}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250321el3l001xo\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
