\par\par \uc2 Business\par \b \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Not for sale\u8217\'20\'19: USPS workers hold day of action to warn of Trump\u8217\'20\'19s \u8216\'20\'18illegal takeover\u8217\'20\'19\b0\par\par\uc2 Michael Sainato \par \uc2 617 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 March 2025\par 16:02 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Employees brace for president to transfer or privatize Postal Service, which they say will slash jobs and boost pricesNever miss global breaking news. Download our free app to keep up with key stories in real time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/us-postal-service"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US Postal Service}}}\uc2  workers and advocates are holding a day of action today in more than 150 cities as they brace for the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/trump-administration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trump administration}}}\uc2  to launch an \u8220\'20\'1Cillegal hostile takeover\u8221\'20\'1D which they warn will slash jobs, boost prices and shut down post offices.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/donaldtrump"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Donald Trump}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s officials are weighing plans to transfer the USPS to the Department of Commerce, stripping it of its independence. The president and his allies have also signaled they are willing to privatize the service.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is the people\u8217\'20\'19s postal service, emphasis on \u8216\'20\'18service\u8217\'20\'19,\u8221\'20\'1D said Mark Dimondstein, president of the \uc2 American Postal Workers Union\uc2 , in a statement on Thursday\u8217\'20\'19s demonstrations. \u8220\'20\'1CIf this administration succeeds in taking over the USPS, it will lead to higher prices and reduced service, especially in rural areas.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Harrison Fields, White House principal deputy press secretary, said: \u8220\'20\'1CThe American people depend on the \uc2 United States Postal Service\uc2 , and it\u8217\'20\'19s unacceptable for political interference to disrupt its operations. President Trump supports the hard work of these individuals and is solely working to make the entire federal government more efficient and uproot waste, fraud and abuse.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The USPS did not immediately respond to requests for comment.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis administration wanted to sell off the postal service for parts the last time they were in power, and it was deeply unpopular. This time is no different,\u8221\'20\'1D said Porter McConnell of the Save the Post Office Coalition, a network of 300 public interest groups. \u8220\'20\'1CMembers of Congress have been hearing from their constituents by the thousands that the mail is getting slower and less reliable, all because back in 1970, Congress forced this public institution to turn a profit, even as its purpose in the constitution was to bind the nation together through communication.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Cities where {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apwu.org/day-of-action"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 actions are being held}}}\uc2  include Atlanta, Buffalo, Cincinnati, Dallas, Denver, Detroit, Los Angeles, Minneapolis, Nashville, New York, Orlando, Philadelphia, Seattle and Washington DC.\par \par \uc2 A flyer in support of the day of action notes privatization would result in higher prices and eliminated services, especially for rural areas that rely on the USPS.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt belongs to the people on Main Street, it shouldn\u8217\'20\'19t be handed over to Wall Street, Dimondstein said. \u8220\'20\'1CThe US mail is not for sale.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Trump {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.nbcnews.com/politics/politics-news/trump-biden-signal-emerging-fight-future-postal-service-rcna184451"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2  reporters at a press conference last December that he was open to privatizing the USPS. In February, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.washingtonpost.com/business/2025/02/20/trump-usps-takeover-dejoy/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports }}}\uc2  surfaced that the president was considering firing the postal board of governors, taking over the USPS and rolling it into the executive branch under control of the commerce department.\par \par \uc2 Ruth Rhoades, who is involved with the local \uc2 American Postal Workers Union\uc2  protest in Redding, California, told the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.redding.com/story/news/2025/03/19/redding-usps-union-protests-doge-cuts-to-post-office-mail-delivery-services/82529227007/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Redding Record Searchlight}}}\uc2  : \u8220\'20\'1CThey are threatening your services here locally. They want to shut down the smaller post offices.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Earlier this month, the USPS reached a deal with billionaire {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Elon Musk}}}\uc2  \u8217\'20\'19s so-called \u8220\'20\'1Cdepartment of government efficiency\u8221\'20\'1D (Doge), permitting it to search for \u8220\'20\'1Cfurther efficiencies\u8221\'20\'1D as the service plans to cut 10,000 jobs through a voluntary retirement program within the next 30 days.\par \par \uc2 At a tech conference shortly before the deal was announced, Musk {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/world/us/elon-musk-says-post-office-amtrak-should-be-privatized-2025-03-05/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  he thinks the USPS should be privatized.\par \par \uc2 The US postmaster general, \uc2 Louis DeJoy\uc2 , a fundraiser and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/virus-outbreak-election-2020-politics-business-nc-state-wire-aedcc34674344793961666fe82d6d257"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 prolific donor }}}\uc2  to Trump who was appointed by the president in 2020, had faced significant criticism over consolidation efforts under his 10-year austerity plan. He {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/business/2025/feb/18/usps-postmaster-louis-dejoy-steps-down"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  plans to resign last month.\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250320el3k0025y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
