\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  tells Republicans he isn\u8217\'20\'19t to blame for mass firings of federal workers\b0\par\par\uc2 Guardian staff and agencies \par \uc2 532 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 March 2025\par 13:19 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Trump and Musk appear to make parallel efforts to distance tech billionaire from radical job slashing in government\par \par \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/live/2025/mar/06/trump-education-tariffs-ukraine-hamas-usaid-medicare-federal-workers-us-politics-live-news?page=with%3Ablock-67ca174c8f08517d2b40b844#block-67ca174c8f08517d2b40b844"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 telling Republican lawmakers}}}\uc2  in private meetings that he is not to blame for the mass firings of federal workers that are causing uproar across the country, while \uc2 Donald Trump{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2025/03/06/trump-cabinet-musk-025093"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reportedly}}}\uc2  told his cabinet secretaries on Thursday that they are ultimately in charge of hiring and firings at their agencies \u8211\'20\'13 not billionaire aide {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/technology/elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Musk}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The two powerful figures appeared to be making parallel efforts to distance Musk from radical {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/feb/13/elon-musk-doge-delete-agencies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 job slashing}}}\uc2  made over the last two months. This is despite the tech entrepreneur boasting about cuts, recommending the US \u8220\'20\'1Cdelete entire agencies\u8221\'20\'1D and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/feb/11/elon-musk-trump-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 taking questions on the issue}}}\uc2  alongside the US president, then {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/feb/23/cpac-elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wielding a chainsaw}}}\uc2  at an event to symbolize his efforts \u8211\'20\'13 all amid legal challenges {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/feb/17/trump-musk-government-cost-cutting-coup"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 and skepticism}}}\uc2  from experts.\par \par \uc2 Musk said {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/trump-musk-doge-cuts-congress-5f2101c129924c9d416437aca05e1e11"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in private talks with lawmakers}}}\uc2  who are experiencing blowback from constituents angry over the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/veterans-affairs-cuts-doge-musk-trump-f587a6bc3db6a460e9c357592e165712"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 firings of thousands of federal workers}}}\uc2 , including military {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://apnews.com/article/trump-federal-workers-veterans-fired-1032360fdc6b2fb33d88edaf8f54d5ca"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 veterans}}}\uc2 , that such decisions are left to the various federal agencies, the Associated Press reported.\par \par \uc2 Despite copious evidence that Musk has acted as if he has the authority to fire federal workers, the representative Richard Hudson of North Carolina, who leads the House Republicans\u8217\'20\'19 campaign arm, said on Thursday: \u8220\'20\'1CElon doesn\u8217\'20\'19t fire people.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHe doesn\u8217\'20\'19t have hiring and firing authority,\u8221\'20\'1D Hudson said after a meeting with Musk over pizza in the basement of the US Capitol in Washington DC. \u8220\'20\'1CThe president\u8217\'20\'19s empowered him to go uncover this information, that\u8217\'20\'19s it.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 That came as Trump told his cabinet that Musk\u8217\'20\'19s authority lay in making recommendations to departments about staffing, not making unilateral decisions on that, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2025/03/06/trump-cabinet-musk-025093"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Politico reported}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The new Trump administration {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/feb/08/elon-musk-doge-team-staff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 created}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/feb/26/trump-executive-order-musk-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 then expanded}}}\uc2  the so-called \u8220\'20\'1Cdepartment of government efficiency\u8221\'20\'1D (Doge) and put the unelected Musk in charge of it, with a mandate to slash jobs and costs across the federal government despite critics\u8217\'20\'19 outcry about a growing US oligarchy.\par \par \uc2 Trump reiterated earlier this week in a joint address to Congress that Musk was the head of Doge, which was quickly introduced as evidence in one lawsuit against the job cutting, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.businessinsider.com/trump-musk-doge-head-address-legal-fight-2025-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 despite recent claims}}}\uc2  to the contrary from Musk and the administration.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s a remarkable shift of emphasis away from the chainsaw-wielding tech entrepreneur whose vast power has made him an admired, revered and deeply feared figure in the second Trump administration.\par \par \uc2 Trump said on Thursday that he had instructed department secretaries to work with Doge but to \u8220\'20\'1Cbe very precise\u8221\'20\'1D about which workers would stay or go, using a \u8220\'20\'1Cscalpel rather than a hatchet\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par \uc2 He later told reporters at the White House: \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t want to see a big cut where a lot of good people are cut.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Then, after suggesting that cabinet and agency leaders would take the lead, he said Musk could push harder down the line.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIf they can cut, it\u8217\'20\'19s better. And if they don\u8217\'20\'19t cut, then Elon will do the cutting,\u8221\'20\'1D Trump said.\par \par \uc2 Reuters and the Associated Press contributed reporting\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250307el37001jl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
