\par\par \uc2 US news\par \b \uc2 Trump administration briefing: Trump changes tack on tariffs \u8211\'20\'13 again \u8211\'20\'13 as US plans to close consulates\b0\par\par\uc2 Guardian staff \par \uc2 1,208 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 March 2025\par 14:14 GMT\par \uc2 The Guardian\par \uc2 GRDN\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Copyright 2025.  The Guardian.  All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Trump shelves Canada-Mexico tariffs; Musk says he is not to blame for mass firings of federal workers \u8211\'20\'13 key US politics stories from Thursday at a glanceUS politics live \u8211\'20\'13 latest updates\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has performed another reversal on tariffs, delaying duties on many goods from Canada and Mexico again. Trump said the reversal has \u8220\'20\'1Cnothing to do\u8221\'20\'1D with turbulence in the stock market in recent days, as investors weighed his economic plans. On Wall Street, the S&P 500 fell 1.8% on Thursday. \u8220\'20\'1CI\u8217\'20\'19m not even looking at the market,\u8221\'20\'1D he claimed.\par \par \uc2 It was also a day where the focus fell on the power wielded by \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  and the president\u8217\'20\'19s plans for US consulates in Europe.\par \par \uc2 Trump shelves Canada-Mexico tariffs - for a time\par \par \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  pulled back from his trade war with Canada and Mexico on Thursday, temporarily delaying tariffs on many goods from the two countries once again. Two days after imposing sweeping tariffs on all imports from his country\u8217\'20\'19s closest trading partners, the US president announced that duties on a wide range of products would be shelved until April.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/06/trump-canada-mexico-tariff-delay-exemptions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  says he isn\u8217\'20\'19t to blame for mass firings of federal workers\par \par \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  is telling Republican lawmakers in private meetings that he is not to blame for the mass firings of federal workers that are causing uproar across the country, while \uc2 Donald Trump{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.politico.com/news/2025/03/06/trump-cabinet-musk-025093"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reportedly}}}\uc2  told his cabinet secretaries on Thursday that they are ultimately in charge of hiring and firings at their agencies \u8211\'20\'13 not billionaire aide Musk.\par \par \uc2 The men appeared to be making parallel efforts to distance Musk from radical {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/feb/13/elon-musk-doge-delete-agencies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 job slashing}}}\uc2  made over the last two months. This despite the tech entrepreneur boasting about cuts, recommending the US \u8220\'20\'1Cdelete entire agencies\u8221\'20\'1D and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/feb/11/elon-musk-trump-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 taking questions on the issue}}}\uc2  alongside the US president, then {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/feb/23/cpac-elon-musk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wielding a chainsaw}}}\uc2  at an event to symbolize his efforts \u8211\'20\'13 all amid legal challenges {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/feb/17/trump-musk-government-cost-cutting-coup"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 and skepticism}}}\uc2  from experts.\par \par \uc2 Trump said on Thursday he has instructed department secretaries to work with Doge but to \u8220\'20\'1Cbe very precise\u8221\'20\'1D about which workers will stay or go, using a \u8220\'20\'1Cscalpel rather than a hatchet\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/06/elon-musk-republicans-federal-workers-firings"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 US plans to close European consulates and cut state department workforce\par \par \uc2 The US state department is preparing to shut down a number of consulates that are mainly in western Europe in the coming months and looking to reduce its workforce globally, multiple US officials said on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The state department is also looking into potentially merging a number of its expert bureaus at its headquarters in Washington that are working in areas such as human rights, refugees, global criminal justice, women\u8217\'20\'19s issues and efforts to counter human trafficking, the officials said.\par \par \uc2 Reuters reported last month that US missions around the world had been asked to look into reducing US and locally employed staff by at least 10% as \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  and his billionaire aide \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  have unleashed an unprecedented cost-cutting effort across the US federal workforce.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/06/us-european-consulates-state-department"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18Not a king\u8217\'20\'19: Trump is told firing of labor chief is illegal\par \par \uc2 A federal court ruled that Trump\u8217\'20\'19s abrupt firing of a former senior official at the top US labor watchdog was illegal, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ecf.dcd.uscourts.gov/cgi-bin/Opinions.pl?2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ordered}}}\uc2  that she be reinstated. Gwynne Wilcox was the first member of the \uc2 National Labor Relations Board\uc2  to be removed by a US president since the board\u8217\'20\'19s inception in 1935.\par \par \uc2 The framers of the US constitution \u8220\'20\'1Cmade clear that no one in our system of government was meant to be king \u8211\'20\'13 the president included \u8211\'20\'13 and not just in name only\u8221\'20\'1D, the judge \uc2 Beryl A Howell\uc2 , wrote in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ecf.dcd.uscourts.gov/cgi-bin/Opinions.pl?2025"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ruling}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/06/trump-labor-board-firing-gwynne-wilcox"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 Musk and Texas governor celebrate after worker fired over pronouns\par \par \uc2 The Texas governor, Greg Abbott, and, later, \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2  showed support on Wednesday for the firing of a state employee who refused to remove his pronouns from his work email signature. Frank Zamora, 31, was let go from his job as a program manager at the Texas real estate commission.\par \par \uc2 Abbott celebrated the move on X. Musk then replied to Abbott\u8217\'20\'19s post with two fire emojis.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/06/musk-greg-abbott-fired-worker-pronouns"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 US attorney threatens top law school over DEI\par \par \uc2 A Trump-appointed US attorney has told Georgetown \u8211\'20\'13 one of the country\u8217\'20\'19s top law schools \u8211\'20\'13 to immediately end diversity, equity and inclusion (DEI) efforts, warning that his justice department office will not hire students or other affiliates associated with a university that utilizes DEI.\par \par \uc2 In an extraordinary letter sent to the dean, the recently appointed interim US attorney for the District of Columbia, Ed Martin, said he was investigating the academic institution after it had come to his \u8220\'20\'1Cattention reliably\u8221\'20\'1D that they were teaching and promoting DEI.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/06/ed-martin-us-attorney-dei"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 DoJ investigating California universities over alleged antisemitism\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 US Department of Justice\uc2  is investigating the University of California system for possible antisemitic discrimination after demonstrations against {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/israel-hamas-war"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Israel\u8217\'20\'19s war in Gaza}}}\uc2  took place on campuses last year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/06/university-california-antisemitism-gaza-israel"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 Democrats join in censure of Al Green\par \par \uc2 The House voted on Thursday to censure Al Green for disrupting Trump\u8217\'20\'19s joint session address, with a handful of Democrats voting to condemn the Democratic Texas representative along with Republicans.\par \par \uc2 The House voted 224-198, with 10 Democrats voting in favor of the censure, which accuses Green of a \u8220\'20\'1Cbreach of proper conduct\u8221\'20\'1D.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/06/al-green-censure-house-trump-speech-democrats"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 Canadians protest against US toxic waste\par \par \uc2 The proposed expansion of a Quebec landfill that accepts hazardous waste from the United States has ignited a turf war between the Quebec provincial government and local leaders, who say they oppose putting US trash into a local peat bog. Local leaders are protesting against the move \u8211\'20\'13 saying the province is capitulating to a US company in the midst of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/trump-tariffs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tariff war}}}\uc2  between Canada and the United States.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/06/canadians-toxic-waste-trump-tariffs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 Small US agency stands up to Musk\par \par \uc2 Members of \uc2 Elon Musk\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s so-called \u8220\'20\'1Cdepartment of government efficiency\u8221\'20\'1D (Doge) unit were barred from entering a small, independent federal agency promoting economic development in Africa on Wednesday after a tense standoff with federal staff they had been sent to fire.\par \par \uc2 Workers at the \uc2 US African Development Foundation\uc2  (\uc2 USADF\uc2 ), which \uc2 Donald Trump\uc2  has ordered to be closed, refused to allow Doge operatives to enter after they arrived at its Washington headquarters.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/06/federal-workers-block-musks-doge-africa-development-agency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2  Read the full story }}}\par \par \uc2 What else happened today:\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 In an escalation of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2025/mar/06/watershed-moment-eu-leaders-close-to-agreeing-800bn-defence-plan-ukraine"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 his pressure campaign}}}\uc2 , Trump said the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/07/donald-trump-nato-alliance-us-security-support"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US will not fight for Nato allies who don\u8217\'20\'19t spend enough on their own defense}}}\uc2 . \u8220\'20\'1CI think it\u8217\'20\'19s common sense,\u8221\'20\'1D the president said. \u8220\'20\'1CThey don\u8217\'20\'19t pay, I\u8217\'20\'19m not going to defend them.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 The state department is hunting for evidence that foreign students who express support for Palestinians under Israeli occupation while studying in the US are \u8220\'20\'1Cpro-\uc2 Hamas\uc2 \u8221\'20\'1D, and can have their visas revoked, based on an AI review of their social media accounts, Axios {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.axios.com/2025/03/06/state-department-ai-revoke-foreign-student-visas-hamas?utm_source=newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=newsletter_axiospm&stream=top"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reports}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 *\par \par \uc2 Trump told reporters in the Oval Office that he will \u8220\'20\'1Cprobably\u8221\'20\'1D extend TikTok\u8217\'20\'19s deadline to find a US buyer or face a ban.\par \par \uc2 Catching up? {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2025/mar/06/trump-administration-briefing-president-hamas-ukraine-tariffs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s what happened on 5 March.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document GRDN000020250307el37000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw127\pich40\picscaley313\picscalex313\picwgoal610\pichgoal192
